# â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•

# Kashier Payment Gateway
# Mode: Test or Live (case-insensitive). Controls which set of credentials is used.
KASHIER_MODE=Test

# Kashier Test Credentials
KASHIER_TEST_MERCHANT_ID=your_kashier_test_merchant_id
KASHIER_TEST_PAYMENT_API_KEY=your_kashier_test_payment_api_key
KASHIER_TEST_SECRET_KEY=your_kashier_test_secret_key

# Kashier Live Credentials (switch KASHIER_MODE=Live to activate)
KASHIER_LIVE_MERCHANT_ID=your_kashier_live_merchant_id
KASHIER_LIVE_PAYMENT_API_KEY=your_kashier_live_payment_api_key
KASHIER_LIVE_SECRET_KEY=your_kashier_live_secret_key

# Site URL used for Kashier return/webhook URLs
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.mrxsteroid.com

